  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WNBA </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR</a></strong></p>\n<ul><li><p>Check out the <strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/1793360738484aa845bd911d1/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo! Sports AM newsletter</a></strong> for my various charts and other contributions, including…</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/1793626087201bdc457cc596d/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Year of the Longshot</a>:</strong></p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!tik8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73f54a7b-4e3f-4a91-957a-22ff26252a0c_2400x2042.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!tik8!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73f54a7b-4e3f-4a91-957a-22ff26252a0c_2400x2042.png\" width=\"828\" height=\"705\" data-size=\"large\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/17937936581398b57fda639eb/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">A trade of Gretzky proportions</a></strong>:</p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!1WDu!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc1166c5-bebe-4e6d-a7cb-684ae5e05ab5_1240x1084.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!1WDu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc1166c5-bebe-4e6d-a7cb-684ae5e05ab5_1240x1084.png\" width=\"1240\" height=\"1084\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/179388036511703f24d9e965b/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The NBA belongs to Gen Z</a></strong>:</p><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!W-qS!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8e5e3983-50bd-46c3-bd57-190c93c334d6_2400x1876.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!W-qS!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8e5e3983-50bd-46c3-bd57-190c93c334d6_2400x1876.png\" width=\"826\" height=\"646\" data-size=\"large\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure></li></ul></li><li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-2016-cubs-and-the-future-we-took\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The 2016 Cubs and the Future We Took for Granted</a></strong> – Ten years after Chicago broke its 108-year championship drought, I revisited the 2016 Cubs to analyze why a team once widely expected to begin baseball’s next great dynasty wound up as a miraculous one-off instead.</p></li><li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/derek-jeter-was-already-an-october\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Derek Jeter Was Already an October Great When He Became “Mr. November”</a></strong> – Twenty-five years after his iconic 2001 postseason, I used WAR and Win Probability data to show how Derek Jeter was already performing like an all-time playoff legend well before “The Flip” and his famous walk-off home run cemented his nickname.</p></li><li><p>🏒 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-nhls-most-productive-player-wants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The NHL’s Most Productive Player Wants Out. When Has This Happened Before?</a></strong> – With Nikita Kucherov requesting a trade, I looked for historical parallels to such an elite franchise cornerstone wanting out at the peak of his powers — and what losing their top star would mean for the Tampa Bay Lightning’s dynastic legacy.</p></li><li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/lamar-jackson-is-becoming-a-what\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lamar Jackson Is Becoming a “What-If”</a></strong> – After a thumb injury put another season in doubt <em>immediately </em>after returning from an ankle sprain, I examined Lamar Jackson’s frustrating pattern of late-season health issues and how his (lack of) availability continues to damage the Baltimore Ravens’ championship window.</p></li><li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-thunder-are-learning-just-how\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Thunder Are Learning Just How Fragile a Would-Be Dynasty Can Be</a></strong> – Coming off one of the most dominant post-merger championship runs by a young core, injuries and departures have already cost Oklahoma City roughly half of its WAR — serving as a reminder of how fast NBA windows can begin to close, too.</p></li><li><p>🏁 <strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/11/05/analysis-where-it-all-went-wrong-for-larsons-championship-challengers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Where it all went wrong for Larson’s championship challengers</a> </strong>- At  this week, as the Cup Series sets its sights on Homestead-Miami Speedway for the season finale, I broke down the key decisions, bad luck and missed opportunities that doomed the Chase field and left Kyle Larson on the verge of another title.</p><ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5mg547QoWsobSF699wqWRt?si=VIRj4AMQQx-8U0Dx6G2NZQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Heading Home(Stead)</a></strong> - In the penultimate  proceedings of the postseason, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I parsed the meaning of William Byron’s dominant Martinsville win — <em>where was this all year?</em> — praised Kyle Larson for staying on track for a title, pondered where it all went wrong for Larson’s challengers, and produced our final betting/one-and-done picks of the 2026 campaign.</p></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/stat-sheet-stuffed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wemby’s massive Game Score</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!51n0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6376f777-316e-40bf-a989-503ef804cb7d_2220x2330.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!51n0!,w_2400,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6376f777-316e-40bf-a989-503ef804cb7d_2220x2330.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"886\" data-size=\"large\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On winning NFL games <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/223173169/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">without a completed pass</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p>🏈<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/who-beat-whom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFP’s contradictory rankings</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/6Cj3S/2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dc1696ea-43fe-4625-bc4e-6fc678008bb2_1220x786.png\" alt=\"Seven wins the CFP rankings overruled\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Seven wins the CFP rankings overruled</p></div>\n<p>🏀<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/223173169/find-the-edge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">expansion-team speedruns</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p>⛳<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/bubble-trouble\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LIV Golf’s massive money-pit</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul><li><p><strong>🏈 <a href=\"https://www.splitzoneduo.com/p/pcsa-bill-2026?utm_source=post-em